        "text": "The introducing models and modules chapters document the original duplicate token reference, attention preparation and prefill cutoff. The Gemma3 and EXAONE4 introducing entries document those adapters following the same convention, with attention guards in prepare_for_attn. The EXAONE4 entry also records a constructor failure that can prevent the changed hook from being reached, and a separate prefill-dictionary reuse problem.",
