      {
        "text": "The Gemma3 introducing entry recorded that Qwen3MoeConfig once supplied a bare class where the factory expected a component mapping. That mismatch is already absent in the parent, which supplies {\"text\": Qwen3MoeModel}; this patch does not repair it. The separate chat-formatting entry recorded Gemma prompt-format issues; the inspected parent still has the same formatter bodies and the patch does not edit them. The direct caller in examples/imgsearch.py now present in the parent passes only the user prompt, so it does not exercise the nonempty-system-prompt case.",
